# BOS live image locales. Calamares detects the languages it offers from
# /usr/share/i18n/SUPPORTED, not from this file, and appends the locale chosen
# at install time before localecfg runs locale-gen on the target. The live
# session needs at least one generated UTF-8 locale of its own: with only
# C/POSIX, Language and Formats offer nothing but "Computer default (C)".
en_US.UTF-8 UTF-8
